@*
    Mock-up icon set: an SVG stroke drawn in `currentColor`.
    Dark mode therefore comes for free — the icon takes the text color, whereas
    the data-URL-encoded Bootstrap icons forced a fixed color and a duplicate
    set of CSS rules per theme.
*@
<svg width="@Size" height="@Size" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
     stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
     aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">@Path</svg>
